Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:09.17,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,A variety of warriors gather at Babylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:11.94,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Mercenaries, well-practiced at combat...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:15.82,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,former holy knights, and people\N with grudges against the holy knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:20.97,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,If you're strong enough, your faults \Nwill be forgiven here in Babylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:23.92,main,Fate,0,0,0,,In other words, they need all the \Nhelp they can get to deal with the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:28.21,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Sounds like a perfect place for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.78,sign_harsh_red,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(400,400)\blur1\c&H0E00DD&\pos(473.437,285)}The Guardian Of Lust
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:10.62,main,Northern,0,0,0,,I'm Northern Alistair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:17.07,main,Northern,0,0,0,,It's an honor to serve the heir to one of \Nthe five great families, Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:21.91,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,In my father's absence, you were \Nresponsible for Babylon's order, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:23.47,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Thank you for your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:28.52,main,Northern,0,0,0,,No. I was unable to save Sir Mason, \Ndespite serving at his side...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.95,0:02:30.59,main,Northern,0,0,0,,For that, I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:33.41,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You were there when he passed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.41,0:02:34.16,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:38.82,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Raise your head, Northern.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:43.32,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I have come here in order to \Nfollow in my father's footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:47.91,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Let us defend Galia from the incursion \Nof monsters and defend the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.22,0:02:49.96,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:03:00.48,main,Miria,0,0,0,,He's making eyes at Lady Roxy! \NHer chastity is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:03.58,main,Miria,0,0,0,,I better get in there and save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:05.06,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Stay put, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:08.58,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,You mess with a holy knight, \Nand it'll be your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:08.58,top,Miria,0,0,0,,But he's buzzing around her like a pest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:13.42,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Mugan, Miria. Let's take a look at the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:14.84,main,Both,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:20.60,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Ten gold coins for a room... \Na gold coin for breakfast...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:23.28,main,Fate,0,0,0,,No amount of money would be \Nenough in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:26.31,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hold it, Fate. Look on your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.69,0:03:30.01,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That scabbard is calling to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:32.23,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It looks ridiculously expensive...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:34.27,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Don't be such a cheapskate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:36.73,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You can always hunt monsters for more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.13,0:03:39.11,main,Jade,0,0,0,,Welcome! Looking for something—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.65,0:03:42.74,main,Jade,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.43,0:03:44.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:46.58,main,Jade,0,0,0,,These aren't regular burns, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:51.73,main,Jade,0,0,0,,They were caused by Fireball... \NNo, probably something even hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:52.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:55.32,main,Jade,0,0,0,,Was I right? Well, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:57.94,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,This guy's got a real eye for detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:03:59.57,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,We can trust his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:01.48,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,We're buying a scabbard from him, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:03.06,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:05.68,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How much does this scabbard go for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:08.77,main,Jade,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just a display model.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:13.49,main,Jade,0,0,0,,If you want a scabbard, \NI'll make one that suits your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.30,0:04:15.48,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This is the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:17.69,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:22.50,main,Jade,0,0,0,,I've never seen a one-handed sword like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.50,0:04:24.45,main,Jade,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:26.17,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You hear that, Fate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:28.83,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like quality recognizes quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:33.63,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,And my glory is so obvious, \Nyou couldn't hide it if you tried!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.53,0:04:37.64,main,Jade,0,0,0,,If you're looking for a scabbard \Nthat'd match a sword like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:40.47,main,Jade,0,0,0,,I'd price that at around 500 gold coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:42.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,F-Five hundred gold?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:45.14,main,Fate,0,0,0,,N-Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.39,0:04:49.79,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like we need to build a war chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:53.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Dammit, 500 gold coins? \NThat's practically robbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:56.70,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Prices are high enough in Babylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:58.41,main,Fate,0,0,0,,We can't spend that much on luxuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.98,0:05:01.07,main,Fate,0,0,0,,First, we need to cover our daily expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:04.16,main,Ruffian 1,0,0,0,,Hey there, warrior in the skull mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:06.62,main,Ruffian 1,0,0,0,,Care to join up with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:09.18,main,Ruffian 1,0,0,0,,You wanna build your rep on a monster hunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:12.83,main,Ruffian 1,0,0,0,,so you can go work as a volunteer \Nsoldier in the capital, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:15.67,main,Fate,0,0,0,,No thanks. I'm not looking \Nto work with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.69,0:05:20.41,main,Ruffian 1,0,0,0,,That's... uh, my apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.41,0:05:24.19,main,Ruffian 1,0,0,0,,I'd imagine that means... \Nyou're an ex-knight, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.71,0:05:28.30,main,Ruffian 1,0,0,0,,You just, uh, didn't look too \Nput-together, so I assumed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.73,0:05:30.28,main,Ruffian 1,0,0,0,,Pardon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:31.58,main,Ruffian 1,0,0,0,,Come on, let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:32.90,main,Warriors,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:37.02,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me for looking shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:42.56,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,See? If you dressed decently, you wouldn't \Nhave goons like them messing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:45.60,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I guess appearances are a part \Nof your defense after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:48.24,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If we're putting a look together, \Nlet's make it a good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.67,0:05:49.86,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:55.03,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,In that case, let's hunt a bunch of beasts \Nand earn a bunch of money!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:01.47,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Past the border is Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:03.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It smells awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:05.97,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's monster carcasses all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:09.76,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What the—?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:10.93,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Spores.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:12.68,main,Fate,0,0,0,,From the moss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:16.17,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yep. Its spores are mildly toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:18.65,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I wouldn't breathe too much \Nof them if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:21.63,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Would it kill you to warn me earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:24.74,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,If you take too many deep breaths, \Nmoss will grow in your lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:28.49,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Don't freak out. That's just how Galia is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:30.75,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This is Galia...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:34.46,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,And it looks like there's a minor \Nstampede already on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:38.92,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:44.76,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Orcs, a type of monster \Nthat are spread all over Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:47.24,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,They arm themselves with simple weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:51.42,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like around 50 of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:54.08,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,They're smart, so they'll use \Na coordinated attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:56.53,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I'd approach this like \Nyou're fighting humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:57.83,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:00.52,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This'll be a chance to show off \Nthe fighting skills Aaron taught me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:07.36,main,Ruffian 1,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.45,main,Fate,0,0,0,,They took the initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:11.29,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What're you doing, you idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:12.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:16.50,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Just get in there and steal the kills, Fate! \NSo I can get that fancy scabbard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.90,0:07:18.72,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Come on, that'd be bad etiquette!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:21.34,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,There's no etiquette or rules \Nto hunting monsters, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Are those... more orcs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:26.08,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,A lot, too. Looks to be \Nabout two companies' worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:28.01,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,They're aiming for a pincer attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:30.00,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Then we won't be stealing these kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:33.55,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yep. A great chance for you \Nto play hero yet again, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:45.34,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You ready, Greed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:46.55,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:56.86,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,So, how do you like my third level?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:59.85,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Completely blocks physical and magic attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:02.50,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,This magic shield is practically a fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:04.58,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You're welcome to start \Nwith the praise, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:06.72,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Shut up! We're in the middle of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:07.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:09.42,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Now what do I do...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.31,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Just rush them, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.31,0:08:14.76,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I'll show you why this shield's so huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:16.91,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Go on, start running and don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:18.10,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This is amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:33.16,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:34.90,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,This is Shield Bash.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:38.46,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It takes quite a bit of strength, which \Nshouldn't be a problem for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:39.61,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Keep on going!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.61,0:08:40.75,main,Fate,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:45.59,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Anyone hungry for mashed pork?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:47.92,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That's just nasty! Show a little tact!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:47.92,italicstop,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:52.39,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
