Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.89,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(335.03,268.683)}Vitality Boost (Low)
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.89,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(474.018,271.916)}Vitality Boost  (Med)
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.89,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(474.736,249.64)}Agility Boost (Med)
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.89,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(335.03,288.083)\fs15}Health Regen
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.89,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(419.629,288.58)}Fireball
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.89,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(336.754,320.345)}Illusion
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.89,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(335.659,305.01)}Fire Resistance
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.89,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(474.758,309.026)}Magic Boost (Large)
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.89,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(473.662,290.406)}Spirit Boost (Large)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:00.56,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.81,main,Fate,0,0,0,,My Gluttony skill isn't acting up...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:05.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Even after beating so many orcs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:08.53,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Has it been like that \Nsince you took down Haniel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.53,0:09:09.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:15.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Could this control be \Nwhat Aaron was training me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.65,0:09:19.48,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Let's clip these orc ears \Nand get back to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:21.50,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.71,0:09:31.28,main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me? Are those all orc ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:34.07,main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,That would be enough \Nfor two whole companies...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.07,0:09:35.43,main,Warrior 3,0,0,0,,And he did it by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.05,0:09:41.39,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'd like to cash these in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:44.32,main,Receptionist,0,0,0,,I-I'll confirm the number right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:48.28,main,Ruffian 2,0,0,0,,Hey, punk! You think you can swoop in \Nand steal our loot like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:49.99,main,Ruffian 2,0,0,0,,Those belong to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:54.68,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You guys would've been turned \Nto mush if it wasn't for Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:55.58,main,Ruffian 2,0,0,0,,Hand them over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:56.56,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:58.34,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This is your last chance to back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.52,main,Ruffian 2,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:02.15,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.15,0:10:03.33,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Let him have it, Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:08.10,main,Ruffian 1,0,0,0,,You rotten...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:11.19,main,Warrior 4,0,0,0,,What're you, new? What's with the mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:12.96,main,Warrior 5,0,0,0,,That's pretty cocky for some rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:14.31,main,Warrior 5,0,0,0,,Let's see your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.75,main,Ruffian,0,0,0,,Dammit! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.07,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Was that Ruinous Strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.07,0:10:25.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.43,0:10:35.52,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,He's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.17,main,Receptionist,0,0,0,,One hundred gold coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:40.37,main,Receptionist,0,0,0,,Here you are, Mr. Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:41.60,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:43.76,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Is it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:52.90,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Are you the one responsible for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:58.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:11.33,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Very well. I understand the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.33,0:11:14.40,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You only struck because \Nthey attacked you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:16.36,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah. It was self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:19.00,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Considering they drew their weapons...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:21.43,main,Miria,0,0,0,,His story matches what \Nthe employees here have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.43,0:11:23.33,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What happens to me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.33,0:11:25.68,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,While I feel you \Nmay have gone overboard...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.68,0:11:30.06,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'm partially responsible for \Nthe degradation of Babylon's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:34.71,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Given that the holy knight responsible \Nfor keeping the peace was absent,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:36.30,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,even if only temporarily...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:38.06,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,She means Sir Mason...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:40.87,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,There'll be no punishment, this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:42.01,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:45.23,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'm willing to overlook this \Nfor the rest of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.69,0:11:50.79,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,All I ask is that you spend \Nthe night in a cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:55.50,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Considering you've been up to some trouble, \Nuse it as a chance to reflect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.31,0:11:58.23,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.91,0:12:02.45,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I used to always look up at Lady Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:06.09,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I guess I've grown?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:07.96,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Excuse me, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:11.42,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah! Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:13.54,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Liar! You definitely weren't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:14.31,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Miria...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:15.67,main,Miria,0,0,0,,It's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:19.55,main,Miria,0,0,0,,And that mask! You're speaking \Nto Lady Roxy, so take it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.18,0:12:20.89,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Stop! This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:22.31,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Miria...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.31,0:12:25.17,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Masks are as much a part of \Na warrior's gear as anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:26.00,top,Fate,0,0,0,,Hey! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.17,0:12:26.38,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Don't be unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.38,0:12:28.10,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:31.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:34.49,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Now then, might I ask your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:35.55,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:37.16,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Your name... is Corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:38.04,main,Miria,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:39.15,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:41.62,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Dammit! Force of habit...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:46.21,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Well, Mr. Corpse, please try \Nnot to cause any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.97,0:12:50.93,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,And... I'd advise taking better \Ncare of your appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.93,0:12:55.59,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,It's... a bit distracting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.55,0:12:59.72,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:01.74,main,Miria,0,0,0,,What is with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:05.16,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,He's so lanky, and seems weak at a glance...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:07.81,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,But if he clobbered all of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.81,0:13:09.69,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,What kind of warrior is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:11.10,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,A good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:16.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I think she hates me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.19,0:13:18.24,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That's better than her \Nfiguring out who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:19.70,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:22.67,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Well, as long as you're wearing \Nthat perception-warping mask,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.67,0:13:25.75,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,no one will realize that you're Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:28.95,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I know that, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:33.13,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,More importantly, even Roxy said \Nyou need to clean yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:34.42,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Let's buy that scabbard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:37.28,main,Fate,0,0,0,,We'll need a lot more money \Nbefore we do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:45.06,main,Jade,0,0,0,,I heard the news! You took out \Na gang of ruffians at the exchange?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:46.23,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.23,0:13:48.55,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It's already become news?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:52.25,main,Jade,0,0,0,,I'd love it if you'd take \Nmy gear into battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.69,0:13:55.77,main,Jade,0,0,0,,Oh, I never introduced myself, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:58.15,main,Jade,0,0,0,,I'm Jade Stratos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.74,0:14:01.34,main,Jade,0,0,0,,I've had my own gear shop for three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:02.61,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:09.28,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So, since you haven't made \Na name for yourself yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:11.89,main,Fate,0,0,0,,you want me to use your \Nwares as advertising?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:12.71,main,Jade,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:16.40,main,Jade,0,0,0,,I've been looking for a warrior \Nwho seems like the right one,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:19.29,main,Jade,0,0,0,,so that we could aim \Nfor great heights together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.29,0:14:21.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:23.87,main,Jade,0,0,0,,Would you like to work with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.43,0:14:29.20,main,Fate,0,0,0,,With an offer like that, \NI've got no reason to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.84,0:14:30.95,main,Jade,0,0,0,,Then...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:33.27,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm Corpse. Pleasure doing business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:36.38,main,Jade,0,0,0,,Likewise! Thank you for agreeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:38.98,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like you've got an exclusive contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.79,main,Jade,0,0,0,,Now I just affix this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:47.37,main,Jade,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.43,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Maybe clothes really do make the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.43,0:14:56.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:59.45,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Uh, I mean, this is better than I had hoped!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.45,0:15:03.23,main,Jade,0,0,0,,That's a relief! Well, it'll be \N80 gold coins for the whole set.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:05.42,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Wait, he's charging?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:07.59,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I thought, since this was for advertising...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:09.27,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Uh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:12.41,main,Jade,0,0,0,,Oh... in that case, how about half off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:13.61,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Half...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:19.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm spending money \Nas fast as I can earn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:20.74,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You can always go on another hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:24.38,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,But first comes food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:30.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This pub looks really busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.17,0:15:32.90,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Maybe that's a sign the menu's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:35.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,As long as it's cheap, \NI don't really care how it tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:55.76,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.23,0:16:00.10,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't look away. What is this impulse...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.57,0:16:03.19,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like you can tell now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:05.19,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,You mean she's...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:06.78,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You guessed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.23,0:16:12.08,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you to show up, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.02,0:16:15.29,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,But I'm wearing the mask! How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.29,0:16:17.72,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,And she even knew my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:22.00,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Because we're two of a kind, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:25.21,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Then she has a Skill of Deadly Sin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:28.81,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I'm Eris. Eris of Lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:34.04,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Here. Take the mask off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:36.85,main,Eris,0,0,0,,The perception alteration won't affect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:38.31,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:42.52,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I want a better look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:46.48,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:51.20,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry about that. \NIt's a side-effect of the Lust skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:54.05,main,Eris,0,0,0,,It gives off an uncontrollable charm effect...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:57.41,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Anyone hit by it, \Nregardless of age or gender,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.41,0:16:59.51,main,Eris,0,0,0,,can't help but love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:03.28,main,Eris,0,0,0,,First, a toast to our meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:16.42,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Y-You said you were waiting for me... \NWhat did you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:21.18,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I've been watching you for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:25.42,main,Eris,0,0,0,,All the way back to \Nwhen you were in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:27.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,For that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:32.66,main,Eris,0,0,0,,When your Gluttony skill awakened, \NI thought about making contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:36.74,main,Eris,0,0,0,,But I decided against it, thinking \Nyou'd encounter Greed sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:42.75,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If you know about Greed, \Nthen do you know about Myne, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:46.03,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Sadly, we've not spoken much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.03,0:17:50.72,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I'm second generation. I don't know \Nanyone from the first generation too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:52.68,main,Fate,0,0,0,,First generation...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:57.05,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Right. The Wrath girl and I \Ndon't get along well, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:18:00.93,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I mean, considering \Nhow much better endowed I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.35,0:18:03.65,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I think she doesn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:06.66,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Those are definitely big.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:08.36,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:12.57,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Speaking of Myne, \Ncongratulations on slaying Haniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.57,0:18:15.58,main,Eris,0,0,0,,She was a tricky one, so I appreciate \Nyou saving me the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:19.36,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You really do seem to know everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:21.04,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I wouldn't go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.72,0:18:25.75,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I don't know who moved the cocoon \Nto where you found it, for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:29.21,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The chimera all come \Nfrom Galia's capital city.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:31.54,main,Eris,0,0,0,,There's probably a few left, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:34.91,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Which will mean real trouble \Nif they're able to mature...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:37.37,main,Eris,0,0,0,,And with how weak the holy \Nknight class has become,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.37,0:18:39.68,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I have my doubts as to whether \Nthey'd be able to exterminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:43.18,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:47.06,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Now, then, it's time I get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:49.52,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What was everything else, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:54.49,main,Eris,0,0,0,,This is the real business. \NThe reason I was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:59.45,main,Eris,0,0,0,,On top of wielding a Skill of Deadly Sin, \NI have another identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:02.91,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I am a guardian of the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:05.50,main,Fate,0,0,0,,A guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:09.93,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Right. I put the kingdom's affairs \Nabove any individual's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.93,0:19:13.05,main,Eris,0,0,0,,To put it another way, \NI'm working towards a better future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.50,0:19:17.24,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Even something that causes a great loss \Ntoday... if, 500 years from now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:20.73,main,Eris,0,0,0,,A millennium, even? It benefits \Nthe kingdom, then I approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:23.43,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:25.77,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Roxy Hart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:32.04,main,Northern,0,0,0,,There appears to be a minor \Nstampede occurring in eastern Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:33.83,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,We'll move to deal with it at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.83,0:19:34.60,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:37.87,main,Eris,0,0,0,,She's going to die in Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.79,0:19:41.45,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What kind of crap is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.77,0:19:47.87,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You want Lady Roxy dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.87,0:19:51.39,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Do you know how the phenomenon \Nof aggression works?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.39,0:19:53.14,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Don't try and change the subject!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.14,0:19:55.65,main,Eris,0,0,0,,I brought it up because it's related.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.91,0:19:59.26,main,Eris,0,0,0,,When a monster is slain, \Nits aggression lingers...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:03.76,main,Eris,0,0,0,,That aggression never really goes away,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:08.11,main,Eris,0,0,0,,and over many years, \Nit builds up bit by bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:12.36,main,Eris,0,0,0,,until it gives rise to a crowned beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.66,0:20:22.12,main,Eris,0,0,0,,And this same phenomenon... \Ncan occur among humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.66,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.41,0:20:25.32,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:28.65,main,Eris,0,0,0,,The oppression, discrimination, \Nand destitution caused by the holy knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:33.30,main,Eris,0,0,0,,All of the aggression aimed at them, \Nbuilding up within the people...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:39.01,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Let's add to that the death of the only holy \Nknight beloved by the masses, Roxy Hart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:45.66,main,Eris,0,0,0,,The swell of aggression born \Nfrom her untimely death
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:48.67,main,Eris,0,0,0,,will swallow the rest that has \Nbeen slowly building up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.67,0:20:52.86,main,Eris,0,0,0,,fueling the birth of a human \Nwith an all-new type of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:59.02,main,Eris,0,0,0,,And among them will be the future pillar \Nof the kingdom, with an incredible skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:05.28,main,Eris,0,0,0,,What do you think? Quite the plan, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:09.58,main,Eris,0,0,0,,Her death will guide this \Nkingdom in a better direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:12.43,main,Fate,0,0,0,,There's nothing good that could come \Nfrom Lady Roxy's death!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.83,0:21:20.59,main,Fate,0,0,0,,None of the holy knights care \Nabout people the way she does!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:25.42,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Her death would not bring \Na single good thing to anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.95,0:21:36.61,main,Eris,0,0,0,,The plan is already in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.22,0:21:39.19,main,Eris,0,0,0,,There's no stopping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:44.62,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I don't care what the scheme is, \Nor who's planning it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.37,0:21:48.36,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,And I don't care who I have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:49.08,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:04.03,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I will protect Lady Roxy!
